
[TestNoPrivateKeyword/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: privateKeyword (1:11 - 1:28)
Message: `private` keyword is not allowed.
Help: Use a `#` prefix instead, so the field is private at runtime and not only to the type checker.
   1 | class A { private value = 1; }
     |           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
